+    /// attacker-controlled sizes before checking `Limits`) / hanging is not.
+    ///
+    /// Each field is independently either sane or adversarial. A quarter of
+    /// the cases are fully sane (a valid Gray8 image), so the decode-success
+    /// path — strip reading and the dimension-sanity assertion — is exercised
